[{"id":"horror_adventures:race_trait:halfling_creepy_doll","label":"Creepy Doll","value":"Text","prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"Glassy eyes and porcelain skin make some halflings look more like dolls than living creatures. If they cease moving and pretend to be a doll while they aren't being observed, they can use the Stealth skill without cover or concealment. A successful Stealth check still allows other creatures to notice the halfling; they just believe the halfling is a doll, similar to the freeze universal monster ability (without being able to take 20). In addition, they take no size penalty on Intimidate checks against larger humanoids."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"The racial trait replaces keen senses and sure-footed."}],"applies":{"Not":{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"horror_adventures:race_trait:halfling_creepy_doll"},"count":1}}},"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false}],"applies":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"horror_adventures:race_trait:halfling_creepy_doll"},"count":1}},{"Not":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_players_guide:race_trait:halfling_low_blow"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_race_guide:race_trait:halfling_ingratiating"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_race_guide:race_trait:halfling_low_blow"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_race_guide:race_trait:halfling_polyglot"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"horror_adventures:race_trait:halfling_acquisitive"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"horror_adventures:race_trait:halfling_attentive"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"horror_adventures:race_trait:halfling_creepy_doll"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:halfling_human_shadow"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_races:race_trait:halfling_unfettered"},"count":1}}]}},{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what